<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vencemos lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vencemos lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lazard Freres &amp; Co said on Monday it had lowered its rating for Corporacion Venezolana de Cementos, or Vencemos, to moderate outperform from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Curtis Butler lowered the rating &quot;given the strong rise in the stock in recent weeks and the inability to assess the timing of volume recovery,&quot; a spokeswoman for the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Butler kept his estimate of earnings per share at $0.34 in 1996 and lowered it to $0.22 from $0.28 next year.</p>
<p>-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879</p>
